      <rules>
        <rule id="7440-52b0-00fb-f7f9" name="Legion Arquitor Bombard Squadron" hidden="false">
          <description>Fan-made formation, not part of EpicAU: the Arquitor Bombard is on the wiki reference sheet, but neither the wiki nor Departmento Munitorum gives it a formation. It is priced against the Predator (60 pts): similar firepower at shorter range, faster, with a 5+ save.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
