      <rules>
        <rule id="f44d-3e39-65cf-f08e" name="Legion Ascalon Squadron" hidden="false">
          <description>Fan-made, not part of EpicAU: a heavy flame tank from Legions Imperialis, converted against the Spartan. Legions Imperialis lists it as Heavy Armour, like the Fellblade, Typhon and Cerberus, which EpicAU makes Lords of War.</description>
