      <rules>
        <rule id="8ea4-62fe-8ba8-4b81" name="Palisade Drop Pod*" hidden="false">
          <description>Only with Drop Assault. One of the formation's Drop Pods is a Palisade: once it lands, units of the formation within 15cm of it have a 6+ Invulnerable Save while they stay in range.</description>
