    </rule>
    <rule id="687a-9b78-a22f-27ff" name="Damocles Command Rhino notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Transport: May carry two Tactical units.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="3227-55ed-fdb2-469f" name="Darkwing Pattern Storm Eagle notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Invulnerable Save(6+). Transport: May carry 3 of the following units, Tactical, Breacher, Assault OR 1 Terminator unit.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="e0e1-b263-44c3-a295" name="Deathsworn Pack notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Count as Tactical Marines for transport capacity purposes.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="b46b-62a2-c978-fcd2" name="Deredeo Dreadnought notes" hidden="false">
      <description>A Deredeo Dreadnought must select either an Autocannon Battery OR Hellfire Plasma Cannon variant before the start of the game.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="5347-68da-e491-3e53" name="Despoiler Squad notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Counts as Tactical Squad for transport capacity purposes.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="a526-2ee7-50df-5002" name="Destroyer Squad notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Count as Assault Squad for transport capacity purposes.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="0d6d-bcfc-a63e-4893" name="Dreadnought notes" hidden="false">
      <description>A Dreadnought must select either a TL Lascannon / Missile Launcher OR TL Autocannon / Power Fist variant before the start of the game.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="4dd3-7c5d-77a9-49a4" name="Dreadwing Interemptor Squad notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Count as Tactical Marines for transport capacity purposes.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="e369-6f4b-eb5b-5b92" name="Drop Pod notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Transport: May carry 1 formation that only includes the following units Tactical, Breacher, Assault, Rapier, Dreadnought. Once landed resolve any attacks against all units within 15cm of the Drop Pod. Units transported disembark and must be placed within 5cm of the Drop Pod or within 5cm of another unit from the same formation that has landed, as long as all units remain withing 15cm of the Drop Pod. the Drop Pod has no further effect.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="ef37-fae8-f4c4-2bc8" name="Ferrus Manus, the Bane of Asirnoth notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Thick Rear Armour, Fearless, Supreme Commander, Inspiring, Invulnerable Save(6+).</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="9486-10c1-7e8e-7f5b" name="Fire Raptor Gunship notes" hidden="false">
      <description>A Fire Raptor must select either Quad Heavy Bolters OR Reaper Autocannons before the start of the game.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="4062-f5e0-5e83-7d85" name="Fulgrim, the Illuminator notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Thick Rear Armour, Fearless, Supreme Commander, Inspiring, Invulnerable Save(5+).</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="b5e7-1712-ad9a-e17d" name="Gal Vorbak Dark Brethren notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Invulnerable Save(6+). Gal Vorbak cannot claim objectives for the purposes of victory conditions. Count as Tactical Marines for transport capacity purposes.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="8e0b-ad7e-b6bf-f920" name="Gorgon Terminator Squad notes" hidden="false">
