    </rule>
    <rule id="a49b-87ca-35ae-9714" name="Land Speeder notes" hidden="false">
      <description>A Land Speeder must select either a Multi-Melta OR Plasma Cannon &amp; Heavy Bolter weapon system before the start of the game. Weapon lines are combined; check the wiki sheet.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="695e-8652-fc4c-4df5" name="Legion Tarantula* notes" hidden="false">
      <description>A Legion Tarantula must select either a TL Lascannon OR TL Heavy Bolter before the start of the game.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="ec22-286a-e45c-6412" name="Leman Russ, the Wolf King notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Thick Rear Armour, Fearless, Supreme Commander, Inspiring, Invulnerable Save(6+), Ferocity.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="2e3a-4a24-fdc0-12cb" name="Leviathan Siege Dreadnought notes" hidden="false">
