      <description>Reinforced Armour. A Saturnine Dreadnought must select either a Heavy Plasma Bombard OR Graviton Pulveriser before the start of the game.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="acdf-45b8-30c0-528d" name="Saturnine Terminators* notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Invulnerable Save. A Saturnine Terminator unit must select two weapons (the same one twice, or two different ones) before the start of the game.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="fe22-9faf-0564-1ad2" name="Sekhmet Terminator Squad notes" hidden="false">
